Package: GsheetGenie
Title: Build Analytical Google Sheets from R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Jesse", "Brandt", , "jesse.a.brandt@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Helpers for writing data tables surrounded by live-formula
    summary rows (sums, means, etc.) to Google Sheets via 'googlesheets4'.
    Focuses on formula-and-layout logic; no formatting or styling.
